    "id": "2633341604",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "【4k】The Starry Night - Vincent Willem van Gogh/星夜 - 文森特·梵·高（1853.03.30 - 1890.07.29）",
    "description": "画家：Vincent Willem van Gogh；\r\n作品问世：1889；\r\n作品背景：\r\nㅤㅤ梵高的夜空是一片沸腾的能量场。繁星点点之下，村子里一片安静。连接地球和天空的是火焰般的柏树，传统上与​​墓地和哀悼相关的树。但对梵高来说，死亡并不是不祥之兆。 “仰望星空总是让我做梦，”他说，“为什么，我问自己，天空中闪闪发光的点不应该像法国地图上的黑点一样容易接近吗？就像我们坐火车去去塔拉斯孔或鲁昂，我们带着死亡去到达一颗星星。”\r\nㅤㅤ这位艺术家将他的经历写给了他的兄弟西奥：“今天早上，我在日出前很长时间从窗户看到了这个国家，除了一颗看起来非常大的晨星之外什么都没有。”这颗晨星，或称金星，可能是《星夜》中心左侧的一颗大白星。另一方面，小村庄是发明的，教堂的尖顶让人想起梵高的故乡荷兰。这幅画，就像它白天的伴侣，橄榄树一样，植根于想象和记忆。将印象派的真理教义留给自然，转而采用躁动的感觉和强烈的色彩，正如在这幅充满活力的画面中，梵高使他的作品成为后来所有表现主义绘画的试金石。\r\nㅤㅤ现代艺术博物馆，MoMA Highlights，纽约：现代艺术博物馆，2004 年修订，最初于 1999 年出版，第 3 页。 35\r\n\r\nPainting background:\r\nㅤㅤVan Gogh's night sky is a field of roiling energy. Below the exploding stars, the village is a place of quiet order. Connecting earth and sky is the flamelike cypress, a tree traditionally associated with graveyards and mourning. But death was not ominous for van Gogh. \"Looking at the stars always makes me dream,\" he said, \"Why, I ask myself, shouldn't the shining dots of the sky be as accessible as the black dots on the map of France? Just as we take the train to get to Tarascon or Rouen, we take death to reach a star.\"\r\nㅤㅤThe artist wrote of his experience to his brother Theo: \"This morning I saw the country from my window a long time before sunrise, with nothing but the morning star, which looked very big.\" This morning star, or Venus, may be the large white star just left of center in The Starry Night. The hamlet, on the other hand, is invented, and the church spire evokes van Gogh's native land, the Netherlands. The painting, like its daytime companion, The Olive Trees, is rooted in imagination and memory. Leaving behind the Impressionist doctrine of truth to nature in favor of restless feeling and intense color, as in this highly charged picture, van Gogh made his work a touchstone for all subsequent Expressionist painting.\r\nㅤㅤThe Museum of Modern Art, MoMA Highlights, New York: The Museum of Modern Art, revised 2004, originally\r\n\r\n其余画作：\r\n1、自画像 - 文森特·梵·高：\r\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2634000827；\r\n2、绿色麦田，奥维尔 - 文森特·梵·高：\r\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2653583022；\r\n3、午休(仿米勒) - 文森特·梵·高：\r\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2690856896；\r\n4、麦田 - 文森特·梵·高：\r\nhttps://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2812523399。\r\n\r\n-------- 更新日志 --------\r\n更新于：11 月 06 日\r\n1、于工坊描述添加了作品背景说明及相关介绍（中英）。\r\n\r\n更新于：10 月 25 日 下午 1:44\r\n1、星月体积光调整。\r\n\r\n更新于：10 月 25 日 下午 1:26\r\n1、星月体积光调整；\r\n2、星月音频响应调整；\r\n3、涡流动效调整。\r\n\r\n更新于：10 月 22 日 上午 10:20 & 10 月 21 日 下午 7:22\r\n1、命名调整。\r\n\r\n更新于：10 月 21 日 下午 7:21\r\n初创，现基于原画作：\r\n1、添加了夜空涟漪特效；\r\n2、添加了星月体积光及沉浮特效；\r\n3、添加了星月音频响应；\r\n4、分组添加了涡流的摆动、流散特效；\r\n5、添加了植被的摆动特效。",
